[ti:Where the Wind Found Us]
[ar:Giuntru]
[re:Automatic line alignment - listening review pending]
[00:11.02]Night breaks open shadows lean
[00:13.66]Your breath is woven into mine
[00:16.24]The storm outside begins to sing
[00:18.74]A trembling pulse along the spine
[00:21.28]We move like secrets in the dark
[00:23.72]Two bodies learning how to stay
[00:26.16]In that soft place where silence marks
[00:28.70]The words we’re too afraid to say
[00:32.12]If the wind remembers everything
[00:36.60]Then let it carry what we bring
[00:43.16]Take me where the wind found us
[00:46.68]In the darkness skin to skin
[00:48.76]No fear no rush just quiet trust
[00:51.18]Your heartbeat folding me within
[00:53.94]If the world falls into thunder
[00:56.44]Let it rage I'll drift with you
[00:58.90]Every storm we break asunder
[01:01.48]Leaves a trace the wind pulls through
[01:04.58]Your voice is warm like flooded light
[01:08.24]Soft edges glowing through the rain
[01:11.02]You touch my name without a sound
[01:13.26]And every tremor feels the same
[01:15.82]Two souls without a map or time
[01:18.26]Just breath that circles in the room
[01:20.80]We shape the dusk we bend the night
[01:23.24]We turn the darkness into bloom
[01:26.44]If the wind can hold what slips away
[01:31.48]Then let it guard the things we say
[01:36.56]Take me where the wind found us
[01:39.26]In the darkness skin to skin
[01:41.28]No fear no rush just quiet trust
[01:43.76]Your heartbeat folding me within
[01:46.46]If the world falls into thunder
[01:48.94]Let it rage I'll drift with you
[01:51.54]Every storm we break asunder
[01:54.08]Leaves a trace the wind pulls through
[01:58.80]We're air we're pulse we're moving heat
[02:00.84]A fragile spark beneath the storm
[02:03.32]We break we rise we fall repeat
[02:05.78]Two shadows learning to transform
[02:08.34]No line no border in the night
[02:10.88]Just breath that knows the shape of us
[02:13.44]If love is wind without a sight
[02:15.90]Then let it cross then let it rush
[02:18.52]Stay where the wind still knows our names
[02:22.54]Where silence warms the coldest frames
[02:27.62]If time dissolves we’ll do the same
[02:33.08]Two souls returning through the flame
